OL,3,GNEWSAApple Music to open concert venue
OL,4,Ain Battersea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US tech giant Apple is to open a
OL,7,Fnew, state-of-the-art concert hall in
OL,8,FLondon, situated underneath its
OL,9,FEuropean headquarters at Battersea
OL,10,FPower Station.
OL,12,FThe 600-capacity venue will host
OL,13,Fone-off shows by major recording
OL,14,Fartists and new bands, all of which
OL,15,Fwill be filmed and broadcast live
OL,16,Fonline.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
